<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= locale %>">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= appTitle %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/client.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <h1><%= appTitle %></h1>
    <p class="intro">
        Real-time rooms over WebSockets: history is replayed on join, presence and
        typing are broadcast to the room, and the client reconnects with bounded
        backoff. A third-party STOMP client may also connect to <code>/stomp/chat</code>
        and subscribe to <code>/topic/chat</code>.
    </p>
    <!-- The inert custom element is upgraded when the client module defines it. -->
    <chat-room
        data-rooms="<%= JSON.stringify(rooms) %>"
        data-default-room="<%= defaultRoom %>"
        data-user="<%= defaultUser %>"
    ></chat-room>
    <script type="module" src="/static/client.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
